WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.370
And he went running 
off on his own anyway.

2
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.610
Seriously...

3
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:10.990
You're always in such a damn hurry.

4
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:16.370
Right now, our top priority 
is to defeat the Dark Triad

5
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.810
and close the gate to the underworld 
so the situation doesn't get worse.

6
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.270
To do that, we need to separate the 
highest-ranking devils and Dante.

7
00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.380
Carefully...

8
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.440
Let's enjoy this... slowly.

9
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.970
Yes, let's...

10
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.490
Torment...

11
00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:36.010
Toy with...

12
00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:37.690
Kill...

13
00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:39.510
Break...

14
00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.030
Yes...

15
00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.320
Yes...

16
00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.760
Yes! This is it!

17
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:53.570
How wonderful! This is 
the world that I wanted!

18
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.030
Hey...

19
00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:57.700
You're fighting me, remember?

20
00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.700
And I'm going to slice you up!

21
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.450
Interesting!

22
00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.210
He's a bit much for Jack 
to take on his own...

23
00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.810
But I'm gonna have to take that bet.

24
00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:11.300
Walgner, did you complete your mission?

25
00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:14.030
All right.

26
00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:16.830
Devil Union...

27
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.660
Mode: Gallus.

28
00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:27.040
Characteristic: Call!

29
00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:50.870
He froze us for a moment.

30
00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.260
He teleported us.

31
00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.550
How delightful.

32
00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:56.380
Devils, you'll be facing me.

33
00:01:59.120 --> 00:01:59.970
Mana Zone...

34
00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:04.010
Dark Prison Hunting Ground.

35
00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:09.150
Now, let this hellish game of tag begin!

36
00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:12.240
I can't see.

37
00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.690
Neither can I.

38
00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:15.940
Let's play with this power.

39
00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:21.000
Yes, let's. Let's compete to 
see who can kill him first.

40
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.310
But we need to hold back.

41
00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.990
Yes. Let's slowly enjoy this.

42
00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.450
Carefully...

43
00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.250
Slowly...

44
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.420
Carefully...

45
00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.560
Mode: Equus.

46
00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:55.780
I knew it.

47
00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.140
Found you...

48
00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.820
My attacks aren't doing 
anything against these guys!

49
00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.660
On top of that, their mana is endless!

50
00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.240
I can't even defend with Equus.

51
00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:08.330
Meaning the only thing I can do is...

52
00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:15.690
keep dodging them until I die and 
stall them in this dark prison!

53
00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.550
So fast...

54
00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.770
By the way...

55
00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.430
You know...

56
00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:21.180
Why?

57
00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.970
Why doesn't he run away?

58
00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.440
Because I live to never 
forgive unjust evil like you!

59
00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:36.690
And I don't even care if I die.

60
00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.290
There were twin brothers in 
the noble house of Faust.

61
00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:50.640
The younger brother was the very model 
of a good person and beloved by many.

62
00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:55.790
He joined the Magic Knights and 
saved people as a matter of course.

63
00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.970
The older brother was 
an awful delinquent,

64
00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.300
and many furrowed their brows at him.

65
00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:05.800
He lived freely and only 
used his magic for himself.

66
00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.810
You're not going to 
join the Magic Knights?

67
00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.770
You could save so many 
people with your magic.

68
00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:15.810
Give me a break.

69
00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.380
What the hell's the fun in that?

70
00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.900
Morgen!

71
00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.660
Mission time.

72
00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.940
Understood, Yami.

73
00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.620
And another weirdo's just showed up.

74
00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:33.800
How the hell did someone like 
you get into the Magic Knights?

75
00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.420
The robe doesn't suit you at all, either.

76
00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.680
Oh? I didn't even see you there.

77
00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:42.300
You still trying to act all edgy? 
How embarrassing.

78
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.820
Look who's talking, asshole.

79
00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.680
I see you two are as close as ever.

80
00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.520
How do you figure, Morgen?

81
00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:55.730
Just make sure you don't go too wild 
and force us to hunt you down, Nacht.

82
00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.230
Who the hell are you trying 
to lecture? Jackass.

83
00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:05.090
I only did whatever I thought was fun.

84
00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.210
I was doing bad things as 
far back as I can remember.

85
00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.580
My younger brother was 
the polar opposite of me.

86
00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.620
He loved everyone, and everyone loved him.

87
00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.670
He was willing to sacrifice 
himself for others.

88
00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:23.330
Just like his magic attribute, 
he was light himself.

89
00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:27.460
Around the time I got my grimoire,

90
00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.070
I heard rumors about some 
foreigner who used eerie magic.

91
00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:33.230
He piqued my interest, 
so I went to see him.

92
00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.270
Who the hell are you? 
You want a piece of me?

93
00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.470
He was pretty wild.

94
00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:50.410
And maybe because our magic attributes 
were similar, oddly enough, we got along.

95
00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.050
We got into a lot of trouble together,

96
00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:57.620
but just enough so the Magic 
Knights wouldn't catch us.

97
00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.210
Six months later, by some weird 
coincidence, he and my brother

98
00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.740
joined the Gray Deer Magic Knight Squad.

99
00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:12.050
I figured there was no way a guy like 
Yami could make it as a Magic Knight.

100
00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:15.680
But my brother got along with everyone, 
so he and Yami got closer...

101
00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:20.010
And it may be because of him that Yami 
got along with the rest of the squad.

102
00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.850
You've got the greatest 
talent for magic, Brother.

103
00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:31.060
Every attempt he made to get me to join 
the Magic Knights was a pain in the ass.

104
00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:36.540
Around the time we turned eighteen, 
I was summoned by my parents.

105
00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.350
You're not gonna lecture me 
now after all this time, are you?

106
00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:44.090
Just forget that I'm the oldest son and 
let Morgen inherit the family title...

107
00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:44.970
No.

108
00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:49.590
You'll be the one to carry 
on the name of Faust, Nacht.

109
00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:50.760
What?

110
00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.890
Shadow Magic...

111
00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.940
Invitation From a Dark Garden.

112
00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.020
Where are we?

113
00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:08.640
Our family has devoted ourselves to 
the study of devils for generations.

114
00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.820
You have inherited that magic and soul.

115
00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.610
Being faced with that 
hideous yet beautiful,

116
00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:17.830
unknown temptation, my body trembled.

117
00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:22.120
My heart grew restless, 
and I was unfathomably excited.

118
00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.630
The malice within me was overjoyed.

119
00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:32.910
In the House of Faust, I was the one who 
fit in, and Morgen was the black sheep.

120
00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.170
As Morgen and Yami became a duo of

121
00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:43.400
light and dark within the Magic Knights,

122
00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.700
I devoted myself to the study of devils, 
and my talent finally got to thrive.

123
00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:52.410
To think that you made 
a pact with four devils

124
00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.630
and became able to fully 
use their powers so quickly...

125
00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.830
You truly are a genius, Nacht.

126
00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:05.630
You might even be able to 
make a pact with this devil.

127
00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:11.050
The underworld is ruled by the three 
devils of gravity, time, and space.

128
00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:14.640
This is one of the devils 
who supports them...

129
00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:18.060
The supreme devil Lucifugus!

130
00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.810
A supreme devil...

131
00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.690
Huh... How interesting.

132
00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.440
Don't do it, Brother!

133
00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.440
Morgen!

134
00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.670
Mother, Father, 
forbidden magic is a crime.

135
00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.690
As a Magic Knight, I can't let this slide.

136
00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.660
And above all, it's 
dangerous! Any more is...

137
00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.830
The danger is what makes it so good.

138
00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.410
A supreme devil... Sounds good to me.

139
00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:45.830
Life is best with a little 
thrill to it, after all.

140
00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:47.110
Brother...

141
00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:51.610
Morgen, you and I are not the same.

142
00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.830
Right here and now, 
I'll surpass my limits!

143
00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:03.930
Summon.

144
00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:16.840
The ritual should be 
suppressing his power...

145
00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.570
so what the hell is this mana?!

146
00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:31.560
He's attacking everyone other 
than the one who summoned him?

147
00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:34.460
I can't move...

148
00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.260
This devil...

149
00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.980
is something we never
should've messed with!

150
00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.560
Morgen!

151
00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:51.850
Is he planning to destroy the relic tied 
to the devil and cancel the ritual?!

152
00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:54.990
Stop...

153
00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.160
A third-party intervention... 
What kind of risk does that...

154
00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.670
Morgen... Morgen!

155
00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:23.330
I guess this is what I get for not 
reporting to the Magic Knights

156
00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:26.250
that my own family was practicing...

157
00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.750
forbidden magic.

158
00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:32.690
You idiot! Why?! Why did you...

159
00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.650
My dream...

160
00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.730
was to stand side by side with you

161
00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:52.070
and protect the peace of this kingdom

162
00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:58.820
as the Magic Knights of 
shadow and light... so I...

163
00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:03.340
Morgen...

164
00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.710
Hey, Morgen...

165
00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:10.040
The very model of a good person.

166
00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:13.590
You shone so bright, I almost 
couldn't look directly at you.

167
00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.480
And that's exactly why...

168
00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:19.740
I... really loved you.

169
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.680
I wanted you to always shine,
even if I couldn't.

170
00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:30.030
I felt like if I stayed next to you, 
I'd sully your brilliance...

171
00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.530
I'm the one who should die!

172
00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:36.870
Please! Save my little brother!

173
00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:39.490
He didn't do anything wrong!

174
00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.130
God, I'm begging you!

175
00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.140
You've really got some 
nerve, you know that?

176
00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:48.380
You spent all this time doing 
whatever you wanted,

177
00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:51.400
and now that you're in trouble, 
you're relying on God?

178
00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:53.820
Give me a break, jackass.

179
00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:56.970
Who the hell would save you?

180
00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.580
I will never forgive myself

181
00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.220
until I die.

182
00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.890
I'm gonna make my own squad someday.

183
00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:25.770
Can you even imagine me as a Magic Knight 
Squad Captain? Hilarious, isn't it?

184
00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.930
If that comes true...

185
00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:35.530
You can be my vice captain and 
be a laughingstock with me.

186
00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:43.300
No matter how much I try to atone for 
my sins, I just can't forgive myself.

187
00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:47.660
I can't let myself receive praise 
or stand in the spotlight.

188
00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:52.660
I can't be like Morgen, 
and I shouldn't be.

189
00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:58.730
Until I die, I will destroy evil 
with evil from the shadows.

190
00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.850
I'm not trying to rectify your evil.

191
00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:16.230
I'm going to kill you before you can
lay a finger on any good people.

192
00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:21.190
Damn it... I never thought 
I'd say these words again.

193
00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:27.230
Right here and now... 
I'll surpass my limits!

194
00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.760
All of the devils I'm contacted 
with are mid-level.

195
00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.500
They couldn't even touch 
these supreme devils.

196
00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:45.020
I know my own limits, and that's why...

197
00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:50.260
Help me with my gamble, 
Plumede and Walgner.

198
00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:56.270
Yes. You showed us things we never 
would've seen in the underworld.

199
00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:58.700
I believe in you, Nacht.

200
00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.030
Right here and now...

201
00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:09.090
I'll surpass my limits!

202
00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:12.210
Devil Union...

203
00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:26.570
Mode: Gallus x Felis.

204
00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:27.840
Oh?

205
00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.090
His magic increased?

206
00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.120
Just for a moment, and only once...

207
00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:37.130
I can boost a spell to the 
class of a supreme devil!

208
00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:49.160
Shadow Magic: Monument of Atonement.

209
00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.120
I'm sacrificing myself

210
00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:58.540
to trap you two in a world of shadows 
where there's no light, life, or death!

211
00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:03.790
You two can play this hellish 
game of tag with me for eternity!

212
00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.080
Impossible...

213
00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.600
My spell... doesn't physically exist...

214
00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.450
yet they broke through it!

215
00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.770
Their magic is...

216
00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.840
magic that burns through everything.

217
00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.600
Devil Flame Magic.

218
00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:58.070
And magic that freezes everything...

219
00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:00.100
Devil Ice Magic.

220
00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.690
Even shadow and light... 
and even invisible concepts...

221
00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.570
G-G-Good... Good...

222
00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.080
Very good...

223
00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.550
Very good!

224
00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.390
Until the very end...

225
00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.060
Wring him out...

226
00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.730
Every last drop...

227
00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.310
Until he's completely empty...

228
00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.980
Those screams of...

229
00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:47.400
...agony...

230
00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.070
...and despair...

231
00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.770
...from humans!

232
00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.500
From the very beginning...

233
00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.080
They've just been playing!

234
00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.080
Ah... I can't...

235
00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:56.580
Yes.

236
00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.800
...hold back anymore.

237
00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.690
Neither can I.

238
00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:00.960
Let's kill him.

239
00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.120
Yes, let's.

240
00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:10.770
Let us hear... your last and final scream!

241
00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:16.920
No human can defeat these...

242
00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.430
supreme devils.

243
00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.610
If anything could...

244
00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.530
Huh? It's severed?

245
00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.910
Hey, you!

246
00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:47.040
What do you think you're 
doing to our vice captain?!

247
00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.630
...it'd be anti-magic!

248
00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.940
Mister Nacht!

249
00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.290
I'm begging you!

250
00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:57.060
If something happens to you, 
they're not gonna let us off easy!

251
00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.330
Gimodelo...

252
00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.930
You're extremely late... 
but now all the cards are in place.

253
00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:09.400
But I don't matter. Hurry up 
and go defeat the Dark Triad.

254
00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.030
Of course you matter!

255
00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:17.780
I was able to get stronger because of you.

256
00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:21.200
I need you to stay alive 
and witness that strength!

257
00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:28.570
Was I... hoping for a new dawn?

258
00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:34.090
You're both good people, 
but you're nothing like him.

259
00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:37.840
All the centuries we 
spent in the underworld...

260
00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:41.590
And we've never had this much fun!

261
00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:46.020
I never thought I'd run 
into you guys over here...

262
00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:50.770
Supreme devils Lilith and Naamah!

263
00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.310
More...

264
00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.770
Entertain us more!

265
00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.220
Can you hit us?

266
00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.310
Keep swinging your sword over and over.

267
00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.330
Can you hit us?

268
00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.310
Can you actually hit us?

269
00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.620
Who...

270
00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.700
...will be hit first?

271
00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.830
Can we kill him?

272
00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.830
My third sword...

273
00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.830
Demon-Destroyer!

274
00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.610
Huh?

275
00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.480
Too bad.

276
00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:24.570
I guess you were the first 
to be defeated, Naamah.

277
00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:31.260
But now we can really play together...

278
00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.940
What?

279
00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:50.730
You are the ultimate prey.

280
00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:54.190
We can't wait to hear you scream.

281
00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:57.560
This isn't exactly one plus one, damn it!

282
00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:01.320
Their mana's so immense, 
I feel like I'm going insane!

283
00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.290
I'm sure this is super impressive and all,

284
00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.120
but I can't sense magic, 
so I can't tell at all!

285
00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.840
Then...

286
00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:26.430
allow us to show you very clearly.

287
00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.630
Damn it all!

288
00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.980
You may survive, 
but everyone else will die.

289
00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:43.400
That sort of thing hurts, doesn't it?

290
00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:44.720
Now...

291
00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.540
grieve.

292
00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.000
All you did was get bigger!

293
00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:57.250
I got bigger, too!

294
00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:03.340
First sword...

295
00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:06.750
Demon-Slayer!

296
00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:11.800
Hey, now...

297
00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:15.140
Just how much bigger are you gonna get?

298
00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.710
You jerk!

299
00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:50.250
Day of Atonement

